# Flutter Clean Architecture

## Estructura por feature

```
lib/features/<modulo>/
├── domain/entities/
├── domain/repositories/     # abstract class
├── domain/usecases/
├── application/providers/
├── infrastructure/datasources/
├── infrastructure/models/
├── infrastructure/repositories/
└── presentation/screens/
```

## Reglas

- `domain/` no importa flutter, dio, ni infrastructure
- `presentation/` no importa `infrastructure/` directamente
- DI en `core/di/` conecta interfaces → implementaciones
- DTOs en `infrastructure/models/` con métodos `toEntity()` / `fromEntity()`
- Estado con Riverpod (`AsyncNotifier` o `StateNotifier`)

## Tests

```
test/features/<modulo>/
├── domain/           # Use cases con mocktail
├── infrastructure/   # Mappers y repos
└── presentation/     # widget tests
```

## Ejemplo use case

```dart
class LoginUseCase {
  final AuthRepository _repository;
  LoginUseCase(this._repository);

  Future<Either<Failure, User>> call(LoginParams params) {
    return _repository.login(params.email, params.password);
  }
}
```
